#X obj 616 11 synth.voice_fofc~;
#X obj 205 93 cnv 1 560 215 empty empty empty 17 7 0 10 -257983 -1 0;
#X text 215 98 Simple formant/vocal synthesizer based on a source/filter
model. The source is just a periodic impulse and the "filter" is a
bank of FOF filters.;
#X text 215 153 Formant parameters are linearly interpolated allowing
to go smoothly from one vowel to another. Voice type can be selected
but must correspond to the frequency range of the synthesized voice
to be realistic.;
#X text 215 223 A cycle of 12 FOF filters with sample-and-hold is used
so that the fof filter parameters can be varied in realtime.;
#X text 215 263 This technique is more robust but more computationally
expensive than FofSmooth;
